---
const faqs = [
  {
    question: "What is SPH Foundation preparing?",
    answer:
      "SPH Foundation is developing a housing program intended to help individuals and families access safe, stable, and more affordable places to live. Locations, program structure, and partnership details are still being confirmed.",
  },
  {
    question: "Is the housing program accepting applications?",
    answer:
      "Not yet. When the program is ready, SPH will explain the formal inquiry or application process here. Sharing interest will not be an application or a guarantee of placement.",
  },
  {
    question: "Who will be eligible for housing?",
    answer:
      "Final eligibility criteria have not been published. Household needs, income requirements, length of stay, and any supporting information will be explained clearly before submissions open.",
  },
  {
    question: "Can an agency make a referral?",
    answer:
      "A separate referral pathway is planned for caseworkers and referring agencies. The required information and consent process will be published before that pathway opens.",
  },
  {
    question: "Where will housing be available, and what will it cost?",
    answer:
      "Operating locations, rates, included utilities, and other program terms are still being confirmed. SPH will publish those details before anyone is asked to apply or make a commitment.",
  },
];
---

<section class="faq-section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="faq-layout">
    <div class="faq-intro">
      <p class="faq-eyebrow">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Frequently asked
      </p>
      <h2 id="faq-title">Questions? Let’s make things clear.</h2>
      <p>
        The program is still taking shape. These answers reflect what is confirmed today
        and will be updated as locations, policies, and availability are finalized.
      </p>
      <a
        href="#contact"
        data-contact-open
        aria-haspopup="dialog"
        aria-controls="contact-dialog"
      >
        Contact SPH
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list">
      {
        faqs.map((faq, index) => (
          <details name="sph-faq" open={index === 0}>
            <summary>{faq.question}</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>{faq.answer}</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
